---
title: "setLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_owner: onlyOwner
    q_check_owner --> q_revert: msg.sender != owner
    q_revert --> [*]: revert Unauthorized()
    q_check_owner --> q_cache: msg.sender == owner
    q_cache --> q_update: previousAddress = s_legionAddresses[id]
    q_update --> q_emit: s_legionAddresses[id] = updatedAddress
    q_emit --> [*]: emit LegionAddressSet(id, previousAddress, updatedAddress)

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: only owner can update addresses
        INV-002: no zero-address validation on updatedAddress
        INV-003: address changes affect all contracts that syncLegionAddresses()
        INV-004: contracts must call syncLegionAddresses() to pick up changes
    end note
